ass=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#94a3b8\">Default</span></button><button class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 group\" title=\"Blue\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background-color:#3B82F6;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#94a3b8\">Ocean</span></button><button class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 group\" title=\"Violet\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background-color:#8B5CF6;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#94a3b8\">Grape</span></button><button class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 group\" title=\"Emerald\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background-color:#10B981;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#94a3b8\">Mint</span></button><button class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 group\" title=\"Rose\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background-color:#F43F5E;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#94a3b8\">Coral</span></button><button class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 group\" title=\"Amber\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-full transition-all duration-200 group-hover:scale-110\" style=\"background-color:#F59E0B;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)\"></div><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" style=\"color:#94a3b8\">Gold</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-red-50/80 dark:bg-red-500/[0.04] border border-red-200/80 dark:border-red-500/20 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 items-start\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-100 d